*

# Dockerfile.native-multistage compiles the application inside the build container, so it
# needs the source and the Maven wrapper. Everything the * above excludes stays excluded
# -- notably .git/, graphify-out/, and all of target/ apart from the entries below.
!.mvn
!mvnw
!pom.xml
!src

# Dockerfile.native and Dockerfile.jvm copy a build produced on the host instead.
# Kept working, at the cost of sending a ~128 MB binary as build context whenever one
# exists -- including to the multi-stage build, which then ignores it.
!target/*-runner
!target/*-runner.jar
!target/lib/*
!target/quarkus-app/*
